SUMMARY:Durham Forest\, South Entrance - Intermediate Hike
DESCRIPTION:GTA Hiking & Stuff\nDurham Forest is one of the few untouched 
 areas remaining in the GTA. We will do a large loop enjoying many scenic v
 iews. It's a great time of year to hike the rolling hills as the forest ex
 plodes with fall colours.\n\nOnce we finish the hike\, for those who are i
 nterested\, we can do lunch at the Hub Restaurant\, which overlooks the va
 lleys below. The outdoor restaurant and patio\nshould still be up and runn
 ing.\n\nThe pace will be moderate\, taking breaks along the way. We can ad
 just as needed. The length of the hike is roughly 9-10 km in 3hrs or less.
 .\n\nCome out and enjoy the crisp fall air and take in some forest bathing
 .\n\n**Note**\n\n- Arrive on time! Cancel if you can't make it.\n- Know yo
 ur limits! Hike within your fitness level.\n- Dress for the conditions.\n-
  Proper footwear is required.\n- Be aware and prepared for ticks.\n- Free 
 Parking.\n- No Dogs.\n- The hike will be canceled if the weather doesn't c
 ooperate.\n\n**We promptly leave at**\n9:37 am.\n\nHope to see you there!\
 n\nYou MUST respond with a YES to the Hike Question in order to participat
 e.\n\n**LEGAL DISCLAIMER AND LIABILITY INFORMATION:**\n\nBy RSVP'ing and p
 aying the event fee (if applicable)\, you are confirming that you have rea
 d\, understand and accept the following:\n\n1. GTA Hiking Meetup is a priv
 ate group. Attending events is voluntary by you as a member. Participation
  in any activity with us is at your own risk.\n2. By joining this event as
  a member you agree to indemnify and hold harmless its organizers\, co-org
 anizers\, assistant organizers\, event hosts\, and other members from all 
 claims or liability of every type (including court costs and legal fees) f
 or injury or death to any person or for damage to property\, loss of perso
 nal property or any other wrongful act arising out of or relating to your 
 participation as a member. This agreement applies to you and to other pers
 ons (as your guests) who may accompany you in these endeavors.\n3. You als
 o agree to hold the organizers as well as other group members harmless. By
  participating voluntarily in the group\, you expressly waive any and all 
 such claims against each and every other member in the group\, including w
 ithout limitation any and all claims against the group organizer\, co-orga
 nizers\, assistant organizers\, and event hosts.
