SUMMARY:[Hike - Beginner] Heber Down - Special Christmas Santa Hat Edition
DESCRIPTION:GTA Hiking & Stuff\n**\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\* Christmas Edition \\*
 \\*\\*\\*\\*\\***\nWear your Santa Hat!\n\nMake sure you join us for this 
 special Christmas & Santa Hat hike as we celebrate the season and winter h
 iking. We have a few other things you can take part in:\n\nThis year we ar
 e supporting SOCKs once again. ([https://www.sockswarminghearts.com/](http
 s://www.sockswarminghearts.com/)) and am asking everyone to bring a packag
 e of socks which we will be donating to the local SOCKs chapter. Last year
 \, we donated 2 bags full of socks\, so would love to top that this year!\
 n\nWe will also be asking everyone to donate $10 or what you can towards t
 he upkeep of this Meetup Group. Most of our events through the year are fr
 ee\, but you can reach out and help us to keep this Meetup group going. Yo
 u can bring cash or feel free to e-transfer $ to [ralfraser@gmail.com](ral
 fraser@gmail.com). Be sure to let me know you're sending me $.\n\nAnd the 
 best part yet!!! When we get back from our hike\, we will have some hot co
 ffee and hot chocolate waiting with some Christmas treats to share and cel
 ebrate Christmas and the upcoming holidays with us.\n\n***\n\nHeber Down i
 s a great spot for a Hike. This is a beginner/intermediate hike. We will b
 e going into the back trails where there could be mud\, so dress according
 ly.\n\n**Please note: THIS HIKE STARTS AT 9:30AM**\n\nBring a water bottle
  and dress for the weather.\n\nParts of the trail can get muddy from the r
 ain. Be prepared.\n\n***Hike leaves promptly at 9:35AM***\n\n**Winter Hiki
 ng Season Information:**\nPlease note that as we get into winter hiking wi
 th snow and slippery trails\, we consider proper Crampons to be mandatory.
 \nThe event host can ask you not to participate if you don't have proper f
 ootwear including Crampons. More [Crampon Information](https://www.meetup.
 com/gta-hiking-meetup/events/297067178/).\n\n**LEGAL DISCLAIMER AND LIABIL
 ITY INFORMATION:**\n\nBy RSVP'ing and paying the event fee (if applicable)
 \, you are confirming that you have read\, understand and accept the follo
 wing:\n\n1. **GTA Hiking Meetup is a private group**. Attending events is 
 voluntary by you as a member. Participation in any activity with us is at 
 your own risk.\n2. By joining this event as a member you agree to indemnif
 y and hold harmless its organizers\, co-organizers\, assistant organizers\
 , event hosts\, and other members from all claims or liability of every ty
 pe (including court costs and legal fees) for injury or death to any perso
 n or for damage to property\, loss of personal property or any other wrong
 ful act arising out of or relating to your participation as a member. This
  agreement applies to you and to other persons (as your guests) who may ac
 company you in these endeavors.\n3. You also agree to hold the organizers 
 as well as other group members harmless. By participating voluntarily in t
 he group\, you expressly waive any and all such claims against each and ev
 ery other member in the group\, including without limitation any and all c
 laims against the group organizer\, co-organizers\, assistant organizers\,
  and event hosts.
